// The production blueprint (crafting.md, 5.4): one item for every
// blueprint a household records. What a blueprint makes, its lines, what
// each slot asks for and the runs it has left are the household's record of
// it, kept under the stack's batch number, which is the blueprint's number;
// the stack names who recorded it. A single, since each is its own record,
// with no lines and no price: it is recorded at a workbench, never bought.
// Named by `assets/crafting/factory.ron`.
(
    id: "veyra:blueprint.production",
    name: "Production blueprint",
    maker: "the household",
    kind: Blueprint,
    stack: 1,
    icon: (shape: Slab, color: "#7FD1FF", symbol: Some("veyra:icon.crafting.schematic")),
)
